WEBVTT

00:00:27.184 --> 00:00:30.772
and every now and then,
the balls collide in midair

00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:32.875
and everybody says, "Wow!"

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:39.517
Then, choosing lots,
we select partners and play doubles.

00:00:39.891 --> 00:00:42.780
But I honestly couldn't
tell you who's won,

00:00:42.804 --> 00:00:46.533
because we change partners
every five minutes.

00:00:47.097 --> 00:00:50.582
And everybody is trying really hard

00:00:50.606 --> 00:00:52.043
to win points,

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:56.177
but nobody is keeping track
of who is winning games.

00:00:56.992 --> 00:01:01.229
And after an hour or so
of furious exertion,